%I A393702 #53 Oct 25 2026 18:58:43
%S A393702 0,0,6,6,169,469,3615,3681,114621,257690
%N A393702 First number to occur at least n times in Weinstein's W sequence (A399995).
%C A393702 Presumed infinite, but there is currently no proof.
%e A393702 The first term of A399995 is 0, so 0 is the first number to occur once, a(1)=0.
%e A393702 The second term of A399995 is also 0, so 0 is the first number to occur twice, a(2)=0.
%e A393702 When we reach term 10 of A399995, the number 6 becomes the first number to appear 3 times, so a(3)=6.
%Y A393702 Cf. A399995, A397175.
%K A393702 nonn,changed
%O A393702 1,3
%A A393702 _Sean A. Irvine_, Jun 28 2026
